  "description": "<p>SynaHealth is a pioneering health and wellness company dedicated to providing innovative solutions for pain relief and overall well-being. Our mission is to empower individuals to live their best lives by offering cutting-edge products that deliver effective results and enhance quality of life.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Synagel: Our flagship product, Synagel, is a topical pain relief gel designed to alleviate discomfort associated with chronic pain, arthritis, muscle soreness, and more. With its fast-acting formula and targeted application, Synagel provides soothing relief exactly where it's needed most.</li>\r\n<li>Synafoam: Synafoam is a unique muscle and joint activator foam that helps reduce discomfort and promote flexibility. Its gentle yet potent formula penetrates deep into muscles and joints to deliver long-lasting relief and support mobility.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Patented Formulas: Both Synagel and Synafoam feature patented formulas backed by extensive research and development, ensuring superior efficacy and safety.</li>\r\n<li>Targeted Relief: Unlike traditional oral medications, our topical products offer targeted relief directly at the source of pain, providing faster and more effective results.</li>\r\n<li>Trusted Brand: With a reputation for excellence and a loyal customer base, SynaHealth is a trusted name in the health and wellness industry, endorsed by healthcare professionals and athletes alike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment terms for our affiliate program are set at 30 days, providing ample time for commission payouts and ensuring a mutually beneficial partnership.</li>\r\n</ul>",
